1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,461
成都的火锅，红油翻滚。第一筷子，先夹毛肚。
Chengdu hotpot, red oil bubbling — the first bite is always tripe.

2
00:00:07,461 --> 00:00:14,211
七上八下——下锅，提起；下锅，再提起。
"Seven up, eight down" — dip, lift, dip, lift again.

3
00:00:14,211 --> 00:00:21,316
大约十五秒，叶片轻轻卷起，脆得能听见响。
About fifteen seconds, the edges just curl — crisp enough to hear.

4
00:00:21,316 --> 00:00:26,645
成都人只说三个字——巴适得板。
A Chengdu local sums it up: ba-shi-de-ban — perfectly good.
